"name": "Hayward Holdings, Inc.",
"description": "Hayward Holdings, Inc. engages in the business of designing, manufacturing, and marketing a broad portfolio of pool equipment and associated automation systems. It operates under the North America (NAM) and Europe and Rest of the World (E and RW) segments. The NAM segment includes manufacturing and selling a complete line of residential and commercial swimming pool equipment and supplies in the United States and Canada as well as flow control products. The E and RW segment is involved in Europe, Central, and South America, the Middle East, Australia, and other Asia Pacific countries. The company was founded on June 1, 2017 and is headquartered in Charlotte, NC.",
